proton-autogen (3.0.2) noble; urgency=medium

  * Added CSV-based game profile configurations.
  * Added a new button to remove game configurations.
  * Redesigned the GTK4 interface and added a new carousel component.
  * Improved automatic Proton prefix management and runtime stability.
  * Added diagnostic log generation via `proton_autogen --diag`.
  * Added GPU profile management with automatic AMD and NVIDIA detection.
  * Added system diagnostics support for Debian, Ubuntu, Linux Mint,
    Arch Linux, CachyOS and Bazzite.
  * Added Lutris export support and game registry integration.
  * Added JSON logging and multilingual UI support.
  * Added launch progress reporting and stable Sensors menu support.
  * Refined Adwaita and Kitty themes.
  * Added game, profile and platform badges.
  * Improved GTK4 layout, responsiveness and desktop notifications.
  * Improved Proton detection, launch reliability and session tracking.
  * Enhanced prefix and configuration management.
  * Optimized executable scanning with intelligent caching.
  * Improved Proton GE compatibility and Wine fallback handling.
  * Fixed MangoHud support for 32-bit applications.
  * Fixed launch return codes, badge refresh and game list updates.
  * Fixed several UI refresh and stability issues.
  * Improved backend/UI separation.
  * Enhanced debugging and diagnostic tools.
  * Performed general code cleanup and internal optimizations.

